msgstr "Ito ang default na tema ng MetaSlider Slideshow."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:26
#: themes/manifest.php:26
msgid ""
"Bitono is a minimalist theme with a 2-color scheme. Recommended for Image, "
"External Image and Post feed slides."
msgstr ""
"Ang Bitono ay isang minimalist na tema na may 2-kulay na scheme. "
"Inirerekomenda para sa mga slide ng Imahe, Panlabas na Imahe at Post feed."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:34
#: themes/manifest.php:34
msgid ""
"Clarity is focused on accessibility. It has easy-to-read fonts, and a "
"straightforward, distraction-free interface."
msgstr ""
"Ang Clarity ay nakatuon sa accessibility. Mayroon itong madaling basahin na "
"font, at isang tuwid, walang sagabal na interface."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:42
#: themes/manifest.php:42
msgid ""
"Databold is a modern, business theme with lots of room for your captions. "
"Databold is recommended for Image, External Image, and Post Feed slides."
msgstr ""
"Ang Databold ay isang modernong tema ng negosyo na may maraming espasyo "
"para sa iyong mga caption. Inirerekomenda ang Databold para sa mga slide ng "
"Imahe, Panlabas na Imahe, at Post Feed."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:50
#: themes/manifest.php:50
msgid ""
"Draxler is a stylish theme that places the navigation arrows in the "
"top-right corner. There's also plenty of room for your captions."
msgstr ""
"Ang Draxler ay isang naka-istilong tema na inilalagay ang mga navigation "
"arrow sa kanang itaas na sulok. Mayroon ding maraming espasyo para sa iyong "
"mga caption."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:58
#: themes/manifest.php:58
msgid ""
"Featuring a built-in button with custom link, Nexus seamlessly integrates "
"key points and interactive elements, making your presentation both engaging "
"and navigable."
msgstr ""
"Naglalaman ng built-in na button na may custom link, ang Nexus ay walang "
"putol na nag-iintegrate ng mga pangunahing punto at interactive na "
"elemento, na ginagawang kapana-panabik at madaling i-navigate ang iyong "
"presentasyon."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:66
#: themes/manifest.php:67
msgid "A standard slideshow layout with a modern design and large, clear arrows."
msgstr ""
"Isang karaniwang layout ng slideshow na may modernong disenyo at malalaki, "
"malinaw na arrow."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:75
#: themes/manifest.php:76
msgid "A clean, subtle theme that features block arrows and bold design."
msgstr "Isang malinis, banayad na tema na may mga block arrow at bold na disenyo."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:84
#: themes/manifest.php:85
msgid ""
"A fun, circular design to brighten up your site. This theme works well with "
"dark images"
msgstr ""
"Isang masaya, bilog na disenyo upang pasiglahin ang iyong site. Ang temang "
"ito ay mahusay sa mga madidilim na imahe"

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:93
#: themes/manifest.php:94
msgid ""
"A smart, contemporary design that is built to blend seamlessly into any "
"theme."
msgstr ""
"Isang matalino, kontemporaryong disenyo na ginawa upang walang putol na "
"sumanib sa anumang tema."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:125
#: themes/manifest.php:125
msgid "This theme places the controls vertically for a unique look."
msgstr ""
"Ang temang ito ay naglalagay ng mga kontrol nang patayo para sa isang "
"natatanging hitsura."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:134
#: themes/manifest.php:134
msgid "A futuristic and linear design that has a unique, horizontal navigation."
msgstr ""
"Isang makabago at tuwid na disenyo na may natatanging, pahalang na "
"nabigasyon."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:143
#: themes/manifest.php:143
msgid ""
"This lightweight design uses numbers for the navigation. The navigation, "
"caption, and arrows are share the same line."
msgstr ""
"Ang magaan na disenyo na ito ay gumagamit ng mga numero para sa nabigasyon. "
"Ang nabigasyon, caption, at mga arrows ay nasa iisang linya."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:152
#: themes/manifest.php:152
msgid ""
"This theme has a special additional functionality that uses image titles as "
"the slide navigation. "
msgstr ""
"Ang temang ito ay may espesyal na karagdagang functionality na gumagamit ng "
"mga pamagat ng larawan bilang nabigasyon sa slide."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:153
#: themes/manifest.php:153
msgid ""
"If you would like to use the image titles as the navigation, you can do so "
"by editing the image title in the media library or manually on the slide "
"(SEO tab)."
msgstr ""
"Kung nais mong gamitin ang mga pamagat ng larawan bilang nabigasyon, maaari "
"mo itong gawin sa pamamagitan ng pag-edit ng pamagat ng larawan sa media "
"library o manu-manong sa slide (SEO tab)."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:183
#: themes/manifest.php:183
msgid "This theme has a unique design that gives it a sophisticated look."
msgstr ""
"Ang temang ito ay may natatanging disenyo na nagbibigay dito ng "
"sopistikadong hitsura."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:192
#: themes/manifest.php:192
msgid "A bold and clear design that works well on a darker images."
msgstr ""
"Isang matapang at malinaw na disenyo na mahusay na gumagana sa mas "
"madidilim na mga larawan."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:201
#: themes/manifest.php:201
msgid ""
"A minimalist theme that gets out of the way so you can showcasing your "
"beautiful pictures. Best used with Image Slides."
msgstr ""
"Isang minimalist na tema na hindi nakakasagabal upang maipakita mo ang "
"iyong magagandang larawan. Pinakamainam gamitin sa mga Image Slides."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:210
#: themes/manifest.php:210
msgid "Cascade is a minimalist theme ideal for vertical sliding."
msgstr ""
"Ang Cascade ay isang minimalist na tema na perpekto para sa patayong "
"pag-slide."

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:218
msgid ""
"The Nivo Light theme included here for legacy purposes. Note: only works "
"with Nivo Slider"
msgstr ""
"Ang Nivo Light na tema na nakapaloob dito para sa mga layuning legacy. "
"Tandaan: gumagana lamang sa Nivo Slider"

#: themes/manifest-legacy.php:226
msgid ""
"The Nivo Bar theme included here for legacy purposes. Note: only works with "
